# Voice pass (1.2.0): signature lines that make each personality recognisable.
# entry: impatient, "on me", "trade me", "send it".  anchor: calm, two short sentences, "They won't pass."
# lurker: "btw", "lol", timing talk, behind enemy lines.  support: "guys", offers utility, encourages.
# marksman: lines, angles, range, "mine".

